    "body": "I can't really tell from that and you haven't provided all the information required for a new issue, however I notice  you have subcategories.\r\n\r\nCheck in the Customiser what options you have set for \"Category display\"  it may be that this should be set to \"Show subcategories and products\" rather than only \"Show subcategories\".\r\nThis option used to be in WooCommerce settings, but rather confusingly it was moved to the Theme Customizer, WooCommerce, Product Catalogue",
