    "updated_at": "2021-03-28T16:34:46Z",
    "body": "I would suggest testing with default theme like Storefront and other plugins disabled (except polylang and woocommerce), then raising a new issue, following all the instructions in the new issue with as much detail as possible in steps to reproduce including what your setup is for category, subcategory and products.\r\n\r\nThe \"Steps to Reproduce\" section needs an exact step by step sequence which could be reproduced in a clean test environment.\r\n\r\nI can't understand the catalogue category/product hierarchy from the screenshots and I also can't understand what the front end screenshots or showing.\r\nUnfortunately I can't read the scripts and languages you are using which doesn't help.  I can only really read English, French, Spanish, Chinese and to a certain extent Portuguese, Italian, Greek.\r\n\r\nI think it's best to close this issue and if you can find a  way of reproducing please open by completing as much detail as possible answering the questions on the new issue ticket at: https://github.com/hyyan/woo-poly-integration/issues/new ",
